    <string name="text_description">
        Fiadanana!
        \n\nIty application dia zaraina maimaim-poana.
        \nMandefasa hafatra mivantana ao amin\'ny Facebook raha manana fanontaniana ianao.
        \nMiala tsiny mialoha raha elaela vao mamaly na tsy mahavaly noho ny antony samihafa.
        \n\nManentana anao hitsidika ny tranonkala Fitiavana voalohany https://fitiavana.org izay
        ahitanao fampianarana baiboly mifantoka amin\'ny fitiavan\'Andriamanitra sy ny fahasoavany.
        \n\nNy fahasoavana sy ny fiadanan\'i Jesosy Kristy ho aminao.
    </string>
    <string name="text_contact">
        Facebook: Ravo Maniry\n https://www.facebook.com/ravomaniry
    </string>
    <string name="text_website">Tranonkala: https://fitiavana.org</string>

